      <title>Prisoner dies in Terre Haute federal penitentiary</title>
      <link>https://www.ipm.org/news/2026-01-25/prisoner-dies-in-terre-haute-federal-penitentiary</link>
      <description>Prison staff found Gary Ray Crowell, 66, unresponsive shortly after 9 p.m., the Federal Bureau of Prisons said in a statement Saturday. Employees performed life-saving measures until emergency medical services transported Crowell to hospital, where he was pronounced dead, the statement said.</description>
